    'dl.m1': 'Download the <strong>.zip</strong> archive: Safari unzips it by itself (otherwise double-click it). Drag <strong>Draco</strong> into your <strong>Applications</strong> folder.',
    'dl.m2': 'Open <strong>Draco</strong>. The first time, macOS says “Apple could not verify…”: click <em>Done</em>, then go to <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</strong>, scroll down to “Draco was blocked” and click <em>Open Anyway</em> (only once).',
